    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. INSTALL SERVICE VALVES"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Lubricate new O-rings with compressor oil. Install the O-rings in the service valves.",
        "(b) Install the service valves on the compressor. Using SST and a torque wrench, tighten the bolts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "07110-61050",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Service valves",
      "value": "260 kg·cm (19 ft·lb, 25 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
